<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Website Saya</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset & Reset Dasar */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        header .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8)), url('https://picsum.photos/1200/600') center/cover;
            color: white;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #0ea5e9;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #0284c7;
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header & Navigasi -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">DevStudio</div>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#home">Beranda</a></li>
                <li><a href="#fitur">Fitur</a></li>
                <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero" id="home">
            <h1>Selamat Datang di Website Kami</h1>
            <p>Kami membantu Anda membangun website yang cepat, responsif, dan modern sesuai kebutuhan bisnis Anda.</p>
            <a href="#fitur" class="btn">Jelajahi Fitur</a>
        </section>

        <!-- Feature Cards -->
        <section class="container" id="fitur">
            <div class="features">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Cepat & Ringan</h3>
                    <p>Website dioptimalkan untuk performa tinggi dan waktu muat yang sangat singkat.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Desain Responsif</h3>
                    <p>Tampilan fleksibel dan tetap rapi saat dibuka dari HP, tablet, maupun desktop.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Mudah Disesuaikan</h3>
                    <p>Struktur kode yang bersih dan teratur memudahkan pengembangan lebih lanjut.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer id="kontak">
        <p>&copy; 2026 DevStudio. Dibuat dengan HTML & CSS.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
